- What changed: E1-open harness (experiments/e1_open/). e1_open.py runs
  100 turns against a vLLM OpenAI-compatible server (Qwen/Qwen3-8B
  default) with KNOWN injected causes as ground truth, scores classifier
  agreement and UNKNOWN rate (pass: agreement >=95%, UNKNOWN <=10%),
  writes JSON + markdown reports to experiments/e1_open/results/.
